# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, which means without this file every
# tracked file is rewritten to CRLF in the working tree and committed back as
# LF. That round trip does not corrupt anything, but it makes a real one-line
# change show up as a whole-file diff, which is how line-ending noise gets
# committed by accident and later fought with in review.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never translate, and never let a text rule try to.
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
